  "details": "Avatars and worlds usually fail to load. If they don't load within a few seconds, their loading progress bar freezes and never increases again. If this happens when joining a world, you have to cancel joining the world and retry (which won't work most of the time). If you manage to get into a world. Avatars will load in for around 3 seconds, but any avatars not loaded in after that will all have their loading progress bars frozen and never load in.",
